WEBVTT

NOTE Draft subtitles for "travellers" — timed to the shot plan. Re-time to the final edit.

1
00:04.300 --> 00:06.800
Welcome to Jeddah!

2
00:07.300 --> 00:11.800
Na gode — thank you! It’s beautiful. What should we see first?

3
00:12.300 --> 00:16.800
And we want to do Umrah on Friday. Is there a simple guide?

4
00:17.300 --> 00:22.800
Use DigitalSaudi — digitalsaudi.pi. It even speaks Hausa and Indonesian.

5
00:28.300 --> 00:30.800
Haba! In Hausa!

6
00:37.300 --> 00:42.800
“Umrah guide”… It says permits are through Nusuk. Good — official.

7
00:48.300 --> 00:51.800
And this — Why Pi in Saudi? I’m a Pioneer back home.

8
00:52.300 --> 00:58.800
Watch “Stay safe with Pi” first. And remember — not every shop takes Pi. Always ask.

9
00:59.300 --> 01:01.800
Okay! Al-Balad next?

10
01:06.300 --> 01:08.800
Discover Saudi Arabia. Explore useful digital tools. Learn about the Pi ecosystem with DigitalSaudi.
